  <description xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">&lt;B&gt;PREP SMARTER WITH BARRON'S. &lt;/B&gt;&lt;I&gt;&lt;B&gt;Barron's AP U.S. History Premium, 2027&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/I&gt; &lt;B&gt;delivers 5 full-length practice tests and in-depth review aligned with the latest course framework. With authentic AP-style practice and expert strategies from educators with years of classroom experience, every study session brings you closer to your goals. Prep smarter, not harder, and ace your exam!&lt;/B&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;NEW TO THIS EDITION:&lt;/B&gt; Fully aligned to the 2027 AP U.S. History exam, including the latest changes to &lt;B&gt;Long Essay Question (LEQ)&lt;/B&gt; and &lt;B&gt;Short Answer Question (SAQ)&lt;/B&gt; requirements. &lt;B&gt; &lt;/B&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;I&gt;&lt;B&gt;Trusted Prep from AP Experts&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/I&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;B&gt;5 full-length practice tests&lt;/B&gt; &amp;#8212; &lt;B&gt;2 in the book + 3 online&lt;/B&gt; &amp;#8212; with &lt;B&gt;detailed answer explanations&lt;/B&gt; to sharpen your test-taking skills&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;B&gt;In-depth review&lt;/B&gt; covering all time periods on the AP U.S. History exam, aligned with the latest course framework&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;B&gt;End-of-chapter practice&lt;/B&gt; that...</description>
</metadata>
